**Issue**: #8
Feature: Open and Merge Pull Request
  Deliver one verified issue through exact-head pull-request merge and issue closure.

  Scenario: AC1 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-open-pr #N exercises this capability
    Then Given a verified exact head, when delivery begins, then version metadata and changelog remain synchronized before the PR is opened.

  Scenario: AC2 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-open-pr #N exercises this capability
    Then Given CI or eligible bot review findings, when the PR is open, then bounded remediation runs against the same head.

  Scenario: AC3 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-open-pr #N exercises this capability
    Then Given human review or ambiguous findings, when encountered, then delivery fails with intervention instead of resolving them automatically.

  Scenario: AC4 current contract
    Given the nmg-sdlc 3.0.0 plugin is installed
    When /sdlc-open-pr #N exercises this capability
    Then Given the exact head merges, when finalizing, then success requires the PR merged and the executable issue closed before branch deletion.
